- Product names imported from "The Instacart Online Grocery Shopping Dataset 2017"
  (the rows tagged `origin: "instacart"` in packages/stores/demo/catalog.json, and
  the rows derived from them in packages/stores/grosher/rehome.json): Instacart's
  dataset terms, which allow non-commercial use with attribution only. Anything
  commercial built on this repository must replace them with data it has rights to.
  See packages/stores/data/instacart/README.md.
- The Outfit and Doto fonts in apps/web/public/fonts/: SIL Open Font License 1.1.

